    "id": "p31-q26-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "26",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following.\n$$\\frac{x^2+4x+3}{x+3}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x+1$, $x\\ne-3$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2+4x+3}{x+3}&=\\frac{(x+1)(x+3)}{x+3}\\\\\\frac{x^2+4x+3}{x+3}&=x+1.\\end{align*}$$\nThe original denominator requires $x\\ne-3$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
